  "termsAndConditionsTitle": "Terms & Conditions",
  "termsAndConditionsContent": "Welcome to DeMiX. By using the application, you agree to comply with the following terms and conditions.\n\n1. Use of the Application\nDeMiX allows you to browse restaurants, cafes, and available products, place orders, and use the payment methods provided within the application.\n\n2. Account\nYou are responsible for providing accurate information and maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. You must not use your account for any illegal or abusive activity.\n\n3. Orders\nAfter an order is confirmed, it is sent to the restaurant or service provider for preparation. Delivery time may vary depending on your location, restaurant status, and operational conditions.\n\n4. Prices and Payment\nPrices displayed in the application are the prices applicable at the time of ordering. Delivery fees or any additional charges will be clearly displayed before confirming the order.\n\n5. Cancellation and Refunds\nThe ability to cancel an order or receive a refund may depend on the order status, restaurant policy, and payment method used.\n\n6. Restaurants and Service Providers\nRestaurants and service providers are responsible for the quality, preparation, and accuracy of the products and orders they provide.\n\n7. Intellectual Property\nAll rights related to the DeMiX application, brand, design, and owned content are reserved. They may not be copied or used without permission.\n\n8. Changes to the Terms\nDeMiX may update these terms when necessary. The updated version will be published within the application.\n\n9. Contact Us\nFor questions or complaints, you can contact us through the support options available within the application.",
