  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyPolicyContent": "At DeMiX, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your data and using it responsibly.\n\n1. Information We Collect\nWe may collect information you provide when creating or using your account, such as your name, email address, phone number, and delivery addresses.\n\n2. Location Data\nWe may use your location to help determine your delivery address, show restaurants and services available in your area, and improve your experience with the application.\n\n3. How We Use Your Data\nWe use your information to create and manage your account, process and fulfill your orders, manage delivery addresses, improve DeMiX services, and communicate with you about your orders and account.\n\n4. Data Protection\nWe take appropriate measures to help protect your information from unauthorized access or use.\n\n5. Sharing Information\nNecessary information may be shared with restaurants or delivery service providers only to the extent required to fulfill your order and provide the requested service.\n\n6. Third-Party Services\nThe application may use third-party services such as authentication, maps, payment, and analytics services. These services are subject to their own privacy policies.\n\n7. Data Retention\nWe retain information for as long as necessary to provide our services and comply with applicable legal obligations.\n\n8. Account Deletion\nYou may request deletion of your account and data through the available options within the application, subject to any information that must be retained by law.\n\n9. Privacy Policy Updates\nWe may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be published within the application.\n\n10. Contact Us\nIf you have any questions about privacy or your data, you can contact us through the support section within the application."
